.TH KM 1 "2026-08-21" "komin-terminal 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
km \- AI-driven command line assistant for Linux system administration
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B km
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.B chat
[\fICHAT-OPTIONS\fR]
[\fIQUESTION\fR]
.br
.B km
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.B history
[\fIHISTORY-OPTIONS\fR]
.br
.B km
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.B shell
[\fISHELL-OPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B km
is the CLI entry point for Komin-Terminal, an AI-driven command line assistant
for Linux system administrators. It communicates with the
.BR komind (8)
daemon over D-Bus to deliver streaming AI responses, session management and
terminal output capture.
.PP
When invoked without an explicit subcommand, the default is
.BR chat .
.SH OPTIONS
.SS Global Options
.TP
.BI \-\-model " M"
Override the default model for this invocation.
.TP
.BI \-\-with\-output
Include the most recent terminal recording output in the question context
(single-shot mode only).
.TP
.B \-\-no\-spinner
Disable the spinner animation during backend queries.
.TP
.B \-\-debug
Enable debug-level logging.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Show program version and exit.
.SS chat Subcommand
.B km chat
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
[\fIQUESTION\fR]
.PP
Single-shot question or interactive session (default subcommand).
.TP
.BR \-i ", " \-\-interactive
Enter interactive multi-turn session mode.
.TP
.BI \-\-name " N"
Create a named session (used with \fB-i\fR).
.TP
.BI \-\-description " D"
Session description (used with \fB--name\fR).
.TP
.BR \-a " " \fIFILE\fR ", " \-\-attachment " " \fIFILE\fR
Attach a text file as context (repeatable, each ≤ 1 MiB).
.TP
.B \-\-list
List all chat sessions.
.TP
.BI \-\-delete " CHAT_ID"
Soft-delete a chat session.
.TP
.BI \-\-switch " CHAT_ID"
Switch the default session.
.TP
.I QUESTION
One or more words forming the question to ask.
.SS history Subcommand
.B km history
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.PP
Manage Q&A history: list, clear, or restore.
.TP
.BI \-\-filter " K"
Filter history by keyword (matches question and answer).
.TP
.BI \-\-since " DATE"
Show entries from this date onward (inclusive, YYYY-MM-DD).
.TP
.BI \-\-until " DATE"
Show entries up to this date (inclusive, YYYY-MM-DD).
.TP
.BI \-\-page " N"
Page number, starting from 1 (default: 1).
.TP
.BI \-\-page\-size " N"
Entries per page (default: 20).
.TP
.B \-\-clear
Soft-delete all history entries.
.TP
.B \-\-yes
Skip the confirmation prompt for \fB--clear\fR.
.TP
.BI \-\-restore " HISTORY_ID"
Restore a soft-deleted history entry.
.SS shell Subcommand
.B km shell
[\fISHELL-OPTIONS\fR]
.PP
Terminal output capture: record an interactive session or show the last
recording.
.TP
.B \-\-enable\-record
Record one interactive shell session (PTY).
.TP
.B \-\-show\-last
Display the most recent recording (ANSI sequences stripped).
.SH EXAMPLES
.SS Single-Shot Question
.nf
km 如何查看系统负载？
.fi
.PP
.nf
km 查看磁盘使用情况 --model gpt-4o-mini
.fi
.SS Pipe Integration
.nf
dmesg | km "分析内核日志中的错误"
.fi
.PP
.nf
df -h | km "哪些分区使用率超过 80%"
.fi
.SS File Attachment
.nf
km -a /var/log/syslog -a nginx.conf "分析 Nginx 访问日志配置问题"
.fi
.SS Interactive Session
.nf
km -i --name debug "排查网络连通性问题"
.fi
.SS History Management
.nf
km history --filter "docker"
km history --since 2026-01-01 --until 2026-08-01
km history --clear --yes
.fi
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/komin/config.yaml
System-wide configuration file (\fB%config(noreplace)\fR in RPM).
.TP
.I ~/.config/komin/
Per-user configuration directory (XDG).
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/komin/
Per-user data directory (XDG) including default session state.
.TP
.I /var/lib/komin/komin.db
SQLite database file for history persistence.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B KOMIN_DBUS_VENDOR
D-Bus vendor segment (default: \fBexample\fR in development,
replaced at build time by RPM \fB%{_vendor}\fR macro).
.TP
.B KOMIN_SYSTEM_CONFIG_DIR
Override the system configuration directory.
.TP
.B KOMIN_SQLITE_PATH
Override the SQLite database path.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR komind (8),
.BR km (1)
.SH BUGS
Report bugs at https://github.com/komin/komin-terminal/issues
